                    "text": "hint、路由、安全与provider分离值得借鉴，公共fetch有IP/协议/DNS约束；这些边界不自动覆盖所有供应商或社交浏览器数据流，移植需按路径验收。 源码依据：[src/host/search-hints.ts](https://github.com/A3Boy/dsh-web-tools/blob/bb68082d1274dc0d28ed5921bb08c7b5070fae7f/src/host/search-hints.ts)、[src/host/routing-policy.ts](https://github.com/A3Boy/dsh-web-tools/blob/bb68082d1274dc0d28ed5921bb08c7b5070fae7f/src/host/routing-policy.ts)、[src/host/fetch-security.ts](https://github.com/A3Boy/dsh-web-tools/blob/bb68082d1274dc0d28ed5921bb08c7b5070fae7f/src/host/fetch-security.ts)。",
